  "product_info": {
    "title": "Microsoft Xbox Wireless Controller",
    "description": "The <b>Microsoft Xbox Wireless Controller – Special Edition Heart Breaker</b> brings a bold and vibrant aesthetic to your gaming setup, featuring stunning pink and purple hues with blue accents. Designed for precision and comfort, it includes <b>textured triggers</b> and <b>rubberized grips</b> that deliver superior control during intense gameplay. <br><br> <b>With Xbox Wireless and Bluetooth® technology,</b> you can effortlessly connect to <b>Xbox Series X|S, Xbox One, Windows PCs, and cloud-enabled devices</b> making it perfect for gamers on the go. Capture and share your best moments with the dedicated <b>Share button</b>, and personalize button mapping through the<b> Xbox Accessories app</b> for a tailored experience. <br><br> Whether you’re gaming competitively or casually, the Heart Breaker controller combines high performance, comfort, and iconic design—built to stand out as much as you do.",
